{"batchcomplete":"","continue":{"gsroffset":5,"continue":"gsroffset||"},"query":{"pages":{"90957078":{"pageid":90957078,"ns":6,"title":"File:Chicago after looting night.webm","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":172773301,"width":1920,"height":1080,"duration":395.258,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/Chicago_after_looting_night.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chicago_after_looting_night.webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=90957078","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2020-06-05 06:15:24","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Chicago after looting night","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Media from YouTube|George Floyd protests in Chicago|Uploaded with video2commons|License reviewed by YouTubeReviewBot|Videos during the George Floyd protests","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>See What Downtown Chicago Looks Like After Night of Destruction Following Protests\n</p><p>Chicagoans woke up to damaged portions of the city with storefront windows broken on Michigan Avenue and State Street after peaceful daytime protests over the death of George Floyd dissolved into looting and destruction. Thieves targeted businesses and vandals smashed windows and set fires throughout the downtown area, but with the city's Loop locked down with only residents and essential workers allowed, the protests spread to other parts of the city. Still, the Loop was the scene of some demonstrations as area transit agencies canceled service.\n</p>\nRoad closures and public transit schedule changes remained in effect, with CTA service suspended and Illinois State Police shutting down several highway ramps that feed traffic into the downtown area.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2020-05-31","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<bdi lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:YouTube_files\" title=\"Commons:YouTube files\">YouTube</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Otw-LtFflDo\"><bdi lang=\"\">Chicago after looting night</bdi></a> \u2013 View/save archived versions on <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Otw-LtFflDo\">archive.org</a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW5rLxiJ306F-bsQzEM7Xzw\">iDiscoverer</a>\n</p>\niDiscoverer","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<div class=\"responsive-license-cc layouttemplate licensetpl\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"rlicense-icons\"><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"w:en:Creative Commons\"><img alt=\"w:en:Creative Commons\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/CC_some_rights_reserved.svg/120px-CC_some_rights_reserved.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/CC_some_rights_reserved.svg/250px-CC_some_rights_reserved.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"744\" data-file-height=\"300\"></span></span><br>\n<span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"attribution\"><img alt=\"attribution\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Cc-by_new_white.svg/40px-Cc-by_new_white.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campai